  "description": "RingMo-lite is a lightweight remote sensing vision foundation model with a CNN-Transformer hybrid framework, designed for multi-task RS image interpretation. It uses a frequency-domain masked image modeling (FD-MIM) pretraining strategy to capture high- and low-frequency features, achieving state-of-the-art performance with over 60% fewer parameters than RingMo.",
